# Android release signing (local only)

Gradle does **not** read this file. Release signing is configured in `android/app/build.gradle`.

Set **one** of the following on the machine that builds the AAB. Never commit secrets or the keystore.

## Option A — environment variables

```
VIBE_TUTOR_KEYSTORE_PATH=/absolute/path/to/vibetutor-release.keystore
VIBE_TUTOR_KEYSTORE_PASSWORD=YOUR_STRONG_PASSWORD_HERE
VIBE_TUTOR_KEY_ALIAS=vibetutor
VIBE_TUTOR_KEY_PASSWORD=YOUR_STRONG_PASSWORD_HERE
```

## Option B — `~/.gradle/gradle.properties`

```
VIBE_TUTOR_RELEASE_STORE_FILE=/absolute/path/to/vibetutor-release.keystore
VIBE_TUTOR_RELEASE_STORE_PASSWORD=YOUR_STRONG_PASSWORD_HERE
VIBE_TUTOR_RELEASE_KEY_ALIAS=vibetutor
VIBE_TUTOR_RELEASE_KEY_PASSWORD=YOUR_STRONG_PASSWORD_HERE
```

The keystore path must **not** live inside the git-tracked tree (including `V:\monorepo`). Losing this keystore means you cannot update the Play listing.

Generate a keystore once with `android/generate-keystore.ps1` (or `keytool`) and back it up offline.
